-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFWirth2002\" class=\"citation book cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Niklaus_Wirth\" title=\"Niklaus Wirth\">Wirth, Niklaus</a> (2002). \"Pascal and its Successors\". In Broy, Manfred; Denert, Ernst (eds.). <i>Software Pioneers: Contributions to Software Engineering</i>. Berlin, Heidelberg: <a href=\"/wiki/Springer-Verlag\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Springer-Verlag\">Springer-Verlag</a>. pp.&#160;<span class=\"nowrap\">108–</span>120. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007%2F978-3-642-59412-0\">10.1007/978-3-642-59412-0</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-3-642-59412-0\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-3-642-59412-0\"><bdi>978-3-642-59412-0</bdi></a>. <a href=\"/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"S2CID (identifier)\">S2CID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:2698265\">2698265</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Pascal+and+its+Successors&amp;rft.btitle=Software+Pioneers%3A+Contributions+to+Software+Engineering&amp;rft.place=Berlin%2C+Heidelberg&amp;rft.pages=108-120&amp;rft.pub=Springer-Verlag&amp;rft.date=2002&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A2698265%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2F978-3-642-59412-0&amp;rft.isbn=978-3-642-59412-0&amp;rft.aulast=Wirth&amp;rft.aufirst=Niklaus&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AModula-2\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\